92186247199 1138 false 13194139533691 true] [17592186247199 1145 "The quotient rule for derivatives gives\n\n$$\n{h}^{′}(x)=\\frac{{f}^{′}(x)\\cdot g(x)-f(x)\\cdot {g}^{′}(x)}{(g(x))^{2}}.\n$$\n\nAs a result, we have that\n\n$$\n{h}^{′}(1)=\\frac{{f}^{′}(1)\\cdot g(1)-f(1)\\cdot {g}^{′}(1)}{(g(1))^{2}}.\n$$\n\nFrom the graph above, we obtain that $f(1)=3$ and $g(1)=2.$\n\nAdditionally:\n\n- The slope of $f(x)$ on $x\\in (0,2)$ equals $1.$ So, ${f}^{′}(1)=1.$\n\n- The slope of $g(x)$ on $x\\in (0,3)$ equals $-1.$ So, ${g}^{′}(1)=-1.$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{h}^{′}(1) & =\\frac{{f}^{′}(1)\\cdot g(1)-f(1)\\cdot {g}^{′}(1)}{(g(1))^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1\\cdot 2-3\\cdot (-1)}{{2}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247201 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247202 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247203 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247204 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1000 #edb/ref 17592186247205 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1041 "selection" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1104 #edb/ref 17592186247205 13194139533691 true] [17592186247200 1110 #uuid "10cf0431-cc21-5deb-8a40-4019c358ec69" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247201 1034 "-\\frac{5}{2}" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247201 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533691 true] [17592186247201 1111 #uuid "8353b5dc-7cd7-5dd4-8896-24138ab0ad3a" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247202 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247202 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533691 true] [17592186247202 1111 #uuid "b8ce6c33-30ba-5cb1-83a3-61b4b3b415ea" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247203 1034 "-\\frac{7}{2}" 13194139533691 true] [17592186247203 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533691 true] [17592186247203 1111 #uuid "4c8c732c-3a67-5773-95c5-05e65b555e6e" 13194139533691